kind: AdaptiveDialog
modelDescription: |-
  Purpose: Resolve or close an existing ServiceNow incident by incident number, including resolution code and resolution notes.

  Use when user asks:

  To resolve an incident

  To close an incident

  To update an incident status to Resolved / Closed / Canceled / On Hold / In Progress

  To add resolution details and complete the ticket

  Examples (user utterances):

  “Resolve my incident”

  “Close ticket INC0010002”

  “Update incident status to resolved”

  “I want to close my ServiceNow ticket”

  “Mark my incident as closed”

  “Cancel my incident”

  “Update my ticket with resolution notes”

  “Change the status of INC0000601”
beginDialog:
  kind: OnRecognizedIntent
  id: main
  intent: {}
